course: dictionary
lesson: 9939
title: Tiny animals that survive
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A tardigrade is a tiny animal with eight legs, usually less than 1 millimetre long. You need a microscope to see one.
explain: Tardigrades live in water, moss and soil, and they are found almost everywhere, from mountaintops to the deep sea. Their name means «slow walker», and people also call them water bears or moss piglets.
explain: Tardigrades can survive extreme conditions. Context helps you understand this: «Dried tardigrades survive great cold, high pressure and radiation» tells you that survive means stay alive through something very hard.
fact: A tardigrade is a tiny, eight-legged animal, usually less than 1 millimetre long.
fact: Tardigrades are also called water bears or moss piglets.
fact: «Tardigrade» means «slow walker».
fact: When its home dries out, a tardigrade curls into a «tun», a dry little barrel, and can survive for years.
fact: Johann Goeze first described tardigrades in 1773 and called them little water bears.
exercise: «Tardigrades, or water bears, are tiny eight-legged animals less than a millimetre long.» How long is a tardigrade usually? | Around 5 centimetres | About the length of a bus | *Less than 1 millimetre | Over 1 metre
exercise: «When its moss dries out, a tardigrade curls into a dry little barrel called a «tun».» What does a tun mean? | A type of moss | A kind of microscope | *A dry little barrel the tardigrade curls into
exercise: Ella says tardigrades must be bears because they are called water bears. What does the name tardigrade mean? | Eight legs | Lazy and rude | Water home | *Slow walker
test: Where can tardigrades be found? | Only on the moon | *From mountaintops to the deep sea | Only in deep oceans | Only in deserts
test: What does a tardigrade do when its home dries out? | Turns into moss | *Curls into a tun | Swims to the top of the water | Grows wings and flies away
exam: «Dried tardigrades survive great cold, high pressure and radiation.» What does survive mean here? | *Stay alive through | Get bigger from | Fall asleep and forget | Run away from
